// Signing settings for the Wander target.
// The real team ID is kept SOPS-encrypted in secrets/signing.enc.yaml.
// Run `scripts/secrets.sh xcconfig` to write the gitignored
// Signing.local.xcconfig next to this file before building for a device.
// Without it, DEVELOPMENT_TEAM stays empty: simulator builds and CI still work.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
